ttps://api.github.com/users/kisg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"See below, it might happen due to an initialization error. In LibGodot the engine does not crash (and takes the whole host application with it), but lets the host application remedy the situation. This is also the reason why we have logging hooks in another PR: So the host application can detect startup errors in detail, and act accordingly. It would be better, if Godot could consistently report detailed errors to the host, but for now we need to rely on parsing logs.","created_at":"2026-09-28T08:03:46Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T08:03:46Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123717#discussion_r4119852513","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123717","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4119852513"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123717#discussion_r4119852513"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123717"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4119852513/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":5412,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":4116837703,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":242,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4119994831","pull_request_review_id":5335807950,"id":4119994831,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc71kiHP","diff_hunk":"@@ -5364,16 +5455,23 @@ void Main::cleanup(bool p_force) {\n \t// Now should be safe to delete MessageQueue (famous last words).\n \tmessage_queue->